window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Protect me at all costs.</p> <p>That’s the mission my father placed on Anton Markov—my new bodyguard. Shield me from a ruthless, faceless stalker. The menace hijacked my online presence, levied chilling threats my way, and promised to unleash a barrage of damage to me personally and professionally.</p> <p>There’s one problem with Anton.</p> <p>It’s simple. I despise him.</p> <p>He stole everything years ago—my heart, dreams, and dignity. With a four-line farewell note stuck to my kitchen table, he broke my heart and almost my spirit.</p> <p>But it seems Anton has his own collection of grievances over what happened in New York, and he’s not willing to let them go.</p> <p>It’s complicated. He hates me.</p> <p>As my stalker escalates his threats, Anton and I are thrust closer together. His smoldering good looks, irresistible charm, and unwavering dedication to my safety blur the line between lovers and enemies.</p> <p>He claims that he can't protect me if he falls in love with me. With the danger closing in, we’re about to put that theory to the test.</p>"; 
